# Patterns are relative to the build context root (the workspace folder that
# holds contracts-and-schemas, shared-sdk-client and the service checkout), not
# to src/. BuildKit reads this file because it is named after Dockerfile.edge.
**/.git
**/.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/npm-debug.log*
**/tests
**/docs
